/* per-scene Jupiter feature set. Longitudes: System II values from the BAA reports converted with L3 = L2 + 81.245 + 0.266 (t - 1965-01-01 0h UT, days) (Morales-Juberias, Simon & Cosentino, App. B eq. B2) */
